  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_anguille_recentes_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Members of an order containing 19 families, 110 genera, and almost 600 species of fresh water and marine soft-finned bony fishes with elongated snake-like or worm-like bodies. [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
